        "subject": "LU-10139 tests: wait for reconnect in recovery-small 108",
        "message": "LU-10139 tests: wait for reconnect in recovery-small 108\n\nWhen the dd in test_108 does not get to do any I/O (it can fail to\nopen its file), the client is idle when ost_evict_client evicts it.\nAn idle client learns of the eviction only from its next RPC, and\nthe statfs sent by client_up fails with -107 while the OSC is still\nreconnecting. lfs df then returns EIO and the test reports \"reconnect\nfailed\".\n\nSend one RPC to trigger the reconnect, wait for the OSC import to\ncome back, and then check with client_up.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=recovery-small env=ONLY=108\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Ic972fa36956973ed638274ea4184dc19e0743ff1\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master",
      "description": "Edit commit message"
    }
